}\pard\plain\s0\qj\widctlpar\f0\fs20\sl240\slmult1 \fi0 Using data from both integral and differential operating conditions, a comparison of the experimental and predicted flowrates is shown in Figure 5. Figure 5a shows that predicted flowrates are close to the experimental values for various catalyst amounts. Figure 5b summarizes the goodness-of-fit in a parity plot. The values for all species are close to the diagonal line and relatively evenly distributed on both sides, indicating a good fit (normalized RMS error = 2.75%).\par
